35,2,1,talk,Mio,,Recruiters take four months to place field crews. We cannot staff physical operations quickly.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,George,,Retention data shows our software tools lost a third of accounts during price hikes.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,May,,Our credit line treats subscription contracts as worthless security. We cannot borrow against them.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Rin,,Holdings with field instruments send verifiable readings. Software ones report only their own dashboards.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Mizuki,,One holding lost five months to a controller shortage. Hardware supply chains are fragile.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Mio,,"@George, if retention is low, our exit stories are hollow. I agree with your concern.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,George,,"@Mio, yes. The write-off ran its own premises. That is a red flag for us.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,May,,"@Rin, if software reports are unchecked, our quarter-end is risky. I am worried.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Rin,,"@May, correct. The audit added six weeks for hardware appraisals. That is a hidden cost.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Mio, the field crew delay means we should avoid companies needing seasonal labor.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Mio,,"The adviser bench has logistics experts, but they have taken nothing on. They are idle.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,George,,The profitable exits sold quiet back-office tooling. That is what we should look for.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,May,,The reserve accounts show equipment-heavy holdings called follow-on money twice as often.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Rin,,The security review for medical records took three quarters. That is a long delay.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Mizuki,,The tool inside the bank's cycle never missed a release. That is the model we want.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Mio,,I prefer software that doesn't require physical appraisals. It keeps our quarter-end clean.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,George,,I am leaning toward the clinic scheduler. It serves independent practices with high retention.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,May,,"I am concerned about the harvest sensor. It has hardware, which means appraisal delays.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Rin,,The fabric loop needs sorting facilities and crews. That is a nightmare for us.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Mizuki,,"The ledger bridge is pure software. No hardware, no supply chain risks.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
